{
  "$comment": [
    "Exact Figma property names and values for instantiating XenDS components from code.",
    "Property names are case-sensitive and must be passed verbatim, including the '#id' suffix on",
    "non-variant props (TEXT, BOOLEAN, INSTANCE_SWAP) — setInstanceProperties fails silently otherwise.",
    "'code_aliases' translates this codebase's prop values to the Figma option; 'defaults' fills in",
    "any variant property the call does not set.",
    "Watch out: the file is not consistent about boolean casing. Tab and Page Header use lowercase",
    "'true'/'false', Menu and Filter Chip use capitalised 'True'/'False', and Toggle uses 'Yes'/'No'.",
    "Always read the options below rather than assuming.",
    "Class names in this codebase say which XenDS component they implement: a class prefixed xds- is a design-system component, anything else (dv-, try-, wh-, ak-, ep-, cl-) is page-specific markup."
  ],
